# 统一换行符，避免 Windows / macOS 协作时整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell 脚本必须 LF，否则在 Linux / macOS 上无法执行
*.sh text eol=lf

# CI 工作流与脚本同理 —— CRLF 会让 Actions 的 shell 步骤报
# `/usr/bin/env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory`
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.apk binary

# 避免 GitHub 把 Java 项目识别成其它语言
*.java text
*.kt text
*.kts text
*.xml text
*.md text
